comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T19:52:44.356Z",codex-agent,"Cause class: contract test pins old host startup side effects. The new SDK no longer recreates schema/workflows.json during a refused command. Preserve explicit-source refusal codes, no rehearsal directory, absence of an unsupported source_unchanged receipt and byte-identical source; assert that caller schema bytes also remain unchanged instead of requiring a startup write."
  "2026-10-28T20:01:50.421Z",codex-agent,"Cause class: contract test pins an obsolete SDK startup side effect. Refusal now preserves the complete caller schema, including the deliberately missing workflow file. Existing explicit-source codes, refusal guidance, no rehearsal directory, absence of source_unchanged and byte-identical source assertions remain. Linked focused tests pass 2/2. Disposable behavioral revert of only assertStartupSourceRefusal restores false !== true; restoring the schema-preservation helper passes 2/2. Build passes."
  "2026-10-28T20:05:14.879Z",codex-agent,"Build and typecheck pass. Focused refusal checks pass 2/2 with disposable old-contract failure and restored-contract pass. Repair CI evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/actions/runs/40759752818. The CI matrix must prove npm and Bun release gates at unchanged thresholds on the final pushed head; queued or running checks are not passes."
